# periodic-text-schema.baseline
#
# Block-header + counter-name schema pinned from
# stats/periodic/*.c.  Regenerate with
#   scripts/check-static/check-periodic-text-schema.sh --regen
# after an intentional schema change; commit the diff alongside the
# code change with a Summary line explaining the drift.
#
# Section markers ("=== name ===") demarcate each source file in
# main/loop.c::run_periodic_surfaces() dispatch order, plus a
# trailing counter-rate-names set for the periodic_counter_rates[]
# table in counter-rates.c.  Lines beginning with '#' and blank
# lines are ignored on compare.
=== counter-rates ===
Periodic counter rates over last s:
+ (./s, total )
=== childop-split ===
childop_split: walltime childop=. (/ ns) syscalls childop=. (/) iterations childop=. (/)
childop_split_json: {walltime_ns:{childop:,syscall:,pct_childop_x10:},syscalls:{childop:,random:,pct_childop_x10:},iterations:{childop:,random:,pct_childop_x10:}}
=== cost-pool ===
cost-pool active: 32bit flat= cheap= exp= 64bit flat= cheap= exp=
cost-pool active: flat= cheap= exp=
cost-pool selector: mode= shadow picks= exp_ppm= predraw cheap= exp= exp_ppm= live cheap= exp= exp_ppm=
=== top-syscalls ===
( total, top = ):
+
frontier-yield kill-list (top by live_misses, total live_misses):
